Have you killed the cubes? IIRC they only destroy the outside container 
when they eat bags, and all of your stuff just goes into their 
inventory. Kill the cube that ate the bag and you'll get it all back 
(sans bag). It sucks to lose the bag but it's not as bad as you think.

Even if you don't have a ranged attack, you can kill the cubes. Just 
pick up anything and everything around the level, then throw it at them. 
Orcish helms work well (the weight of the item increases damage). That's 
what I do to deal with floating eyes, jellies, and gelatenous cubes 
early on.

